    "body": "it might or might not be right, but in v3 this is how the cache key is computed, also from the parameters, not from the result: \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-client-javascript/blob/5c1ce1308749aa0807940456393aa23ae46fb9eb/src/AlgoliaSearchCore.js#L232-L240",
